 "even when they differ in 3D size or proportion - and transfers a cut, an unwrap or a stacking from one to all the others. Stacking the matches on top of each other also lets them share the same texture space, saving resolution.\n\nThe Similarity slider sets how close a match has to be before the transfer applies: loosen it to catch near-duplicates, tighten it to keep only exact ones.": "3D 中大小或比例不同，也会把一个岛的切口、展开或堆叠传递给其余岛。把匹配项叠放还能共享同一纹理空间，节省分辨率。\n\n“相似度”滑块决定匹配接近到什么程度才执行传递。调低可捕获近似重复项，调高则只保留完全相同的项。",
