 "Marker count": "标记数量",
 "Draws around every island the area that the packing padding reserves for it, so that islands can be spaced by eye without running a pack.\n\nHalf of the padding is drawn on each island, which means two islands are correctly spaced as soon as their zones touch: the packer only ever needs one padding of clearance between them, not one per island.\n\nThe zone follows the island's real outline with rounded corners, and it is expressed in texture space, so it grows and shrinks with the padding, the map resolution and the zoom.": "在每个岛周围绘制打包填充为其预留的区域，这样无需运行打包即可用肉眼调整岛之间的间距。\n\n每个岛各绘制一半填充，这意味着当两个岛的填充区相接时即为正确间距：打包器只需在它们之间保留一份填充间隙，而不是每个岛各留一份。\n\n该区域沿岛的真实轮廓以圆角呈现，并以纹理空间表示，因此会随填充量、贴图分辨率和缩放而增减。",
